    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίξ</span></b> , ὁ and ἡ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῑχός,</span>
		nom. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῖχες</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crumb, morsel, bit,</i> esp. of
			bread, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.77f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CA</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.40
			</span></i>.— <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has also the plurals <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίχαι,
			ψίχηνα</span> (s. v. l.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιχίον.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
